<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23842" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκά-μηνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ten months old,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκύλαξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyn.</u>
					7.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				24.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>in the tenth month,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ αἵρεσις ἐγένετο ἔς τι δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δ.</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδία</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Septim.</u>
				7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυνὴ κυεῖ δ.</span> prob. l. in
				<i><span class="en">
				Men.
				413
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόκος δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>GA</u>
					777b14
				</span></i>
			: neut. pl. as Adv., ib.<i><span class="en">
				772b9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>consisting of ten months,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ δ.</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίοδος</span>) <i><span class="en">
				<u>Placit.</u>
				5.18.1
			</span></i>: Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκάμηνον, τό,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Schwyzer</u>
				195.12
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRyl.</u>
				88.17
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>.</div>
